@startuml
title UC0 - Hello Agent - API Ask Flow

actor User
participant "UC0 API (FastAPI)" as API
participant "Workflow (UC0)" as WF
participant "LLM Wrapper (UC0)" as LLM
participant "OpenAI API" as OpenAI

User -> API : HTTP POST /uc0/chat\n(history, user_input)
API -> WF : add_user_and_respond(history, user_input)
WF -> LLM : chat_completion_uc0(messages)
LLM -> OpenAI : chat.completions(...)
OpenAI --> LLM : response
LLM --> WF : reply text
WF --> API : updated history (JSON)
API --> User : HTTP 200 (history with assistant reply)

@enduml
